Flow: Answer a user message
Id: conversation.answer-message

  Screen: Conversation
  Id: conversation.screen

    Shows
      Assistant response in the conversation
      Quick replies below the assistant response when available
      Assistant response without quick replies when product search fails

  When the user sends a message

    At the same time

      Action: Find relevant products
      Id: conversation.find-products

        Receives
          User message

        Steps
          Find products relevant to the user message
          Rank the matching products

        Outcome
          Product results are available

      Action: Create assistant response
      Id: conversation.create-response

        Receives
          User message

        Steps
          Interpret the user’s request
          Create a relevant response

        Outcome
          Assistant response is available

    Once assistant response is available

      Action: Show assistant response
      Id: conversation.show-response

        Receives
          Assistant response

        Steps
          Display the assistant response in the conversation

        Outcome
          Assistant response is shown

    Once product results are available

      Action: Create quick replies
      Id: conversation.create-quick-replies

        Receives
          User message
          Product results

        Rules
          Show no more than 3 quick replies
          Quick replies must use available product information

        Steps
          Inspect the best product-search result

          If the best result is a brand
            Create product chips from that brand

          Otherwise
            Create relevant category chips

        Outcome
          Quick replies are available

    Once quick replies are available

      Action: Show quick replies
      Id: conversation.show-quick-replies

        Receives
          Quick replies

        Steps
          Display quick replies below the assistant response

        Outcome
          Quick replies are shown

    If product search fails

      Action: Continue without quick replies
      Id: conversation.continue-without-quick-replies

        Steps
          Keep the assistant response visible without quick replies

        Outcome
          Conversation remains usable

  # --- Additional highlighting samples ---

  # Concise Screen interactions (implicit Actions parse as Actions; TextMate
  # does not specially highlight the bare interaction name lines)
  Flow Start free meditation
  Screen Choose focus
    Shows
      Focus options
    Select focus
      Rules
        Focus must be one of Breathing, Visualization, Affirmation, Balanced
      Store selected focus
      Go to Choose voice
  Screen Choose voice
    Select voice
      If the voice requires Premium
        Go to Premium paywall
      Otherwise
        Store selected voice

  # Section + Layout (structural UI regions)
  Flow Today workspace
  Screen Today
    Shows
      Areas in Sidebar
      Today's tasks in Content
      Selected task details in Inspector
    Layout
      Sidebar | Content | Inspector
      Rules
        Sidebar can be collapsed
      When the user enters the mobile breakpoint
        Layout
          Sidebar
          Content
          Inspector
    Section Sidebar
    Section Content
    Section Inspector

  # Highlighting for Id definitions and Id-shaped Go to targets
  Action Bootstrap conversation
  Id conversation.bootstrap
    Steps
      Go to conversation.bootstrap
      Go to Conversation

  # Optional colons omitted
  Flow Answer a user message
  Id conversation.answer-message-alt
  Screen Conversation
  Id conversation.screen-alt
  Action Create quick replies
  Id conversation.create-quick-replies-alt

  # Deprecated uppercase (still highlighted; prefer Title Case)
  FLOW Deprecated sample flow
  ID samples.deprecated-flow

  # Numbers and durations
  Action: Timing sample
  Id: samples.timing
  Rules
    Wait no longer than 10 minutes
    Retry after 5 seconds
    Cache for 1 hour
    Show no more than 3 quick replies

  # Quoted strings (apostrophes in prose must not open strings)
  Screen: Welcome email
  Id: samples.send-welcome
    Shows
      Greeting with "welcome" and 'user name'
      Stored user name when provided
      Stored user email address when provided

  # Directive-like words in normal text should NOT highlight
  Action: Prose sample
  Id: samples.prose
  Rules
    Only show this when product results are available
    Do not run if the user is anonymous
    Follow the rules in the brand guide
